# Git Workflow

## Push Policy

**NEVER run `git push` without explicit user approval.**

- Committing locally is fine.
- Always stop after `git commit` and show the commit hash/message.
- Only push after the user explicitly says "push", "go ahead", "deploy", or similar confirmation.
- If the user asks to "commit and push" in the same message, still stop before the push and confirm.
